================================================================================
Bundled fonts
================================================================================

One font file is redistributed, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The full
licence text is in licenses/OFL-1.1.txt.

  IBM Plex Sans    Copyright (c) 2019 IBM Corp.
                   app/src/main/res/font/ibm_plex_sans_variable.ttf
                   Window Ver/src/main/resources/font/ibm_plex_sans_variable.ttf

Everything else is set in the platform's generic serif family, which resolves to
a font already on the user's device (DirectWrite on Windows, the system serif on
Android). No serif font is bundled or redistributed by this project.


